# Tests & CI

## Run tests after changes
- Run relevant tests after every change (note if the suite is not runnable yet).

## No feature without tests
- Any new behavior must include unit tests and/or integration tests.
- Exceptions must be explicitly documented in PR description.

## Required test types
- Unit: normalization, safety gating, evidence formatting.
- Integration: graph happy paths, degraded paths.
- MCP contract: tools exist + schema compatibility.

## CI hygiene
- Keep tests deterministic; avoid network where possible.
- If tests require MCP servers, provide mocks/fallback for CI or mark as optional with clear docs.
